CATEGORIES:Comedy Event Types Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerLower Nob Hill Weekly Cleanup 
 w/ Free Lunch for Volunteers (SF)Lower Nob Hill Weekly Cleanup\nSundays\, 
 9:45 AM to 11:00 AM\n\nMeet outside Another Cafe at 1191 Pine St\nGrab a p
 icker\, meet the people on your block\, and leave the sidewalks cleaner th
 an you found them. We provide all the supplies: grabbers\, bags\, gloves\,
  and vests. Just wear comfortable shoes and show up.\nWhat volunteers get:
 \n\nA free sandwich\, salad\, or drink and pastry from Another Cafe\, read
 y when the cleanup ends\nA chance at free tickets to that evening’s 7:45
  PM stand-up comedy show at Cheaper Than Therapy (533 Sutter St)\, a neigh
 borhood comedy club around the corner from Union Square. Seats are limited
  each week and go to volunteers who claim them at check-in.\n\nEveryone is
  welcome\, including first-timers\, families\, and drop-ins. Check in with
  a QR code when you arrive. (Comedy tickets are for volunteers 18+.)\nOrga
 nized by neighborhood volunteers in partnership with Civic Joy Fund and SF
  Public Works.\n\nUpcoming Lower Nob Hill Weekly Cleanup w/ Free Lunch for
  Volunteers (SF) Events\nSun 10/11 Lower Nob Hill Weekly Cleanup w/ Free L
 unch for Volunteers (SF)Sun 10/18 Lower Nob Hill Weekly Cleanup w/ Free Lu
 nch for Volunteers (SF)Sun 10/25 Lower Nob Hill Weekly Cleanup w/ Free Lun
 ch for Volunteers (SF)Sun 11/1 Lower Nob Hill Weekly Cleanup w/ Free Lunch
  for Volunteers (SF)Disclaimer: Please double check event information with
  the event organizer as events can be canceled\, details can c...\n\nFree\
 n\nTickets: https://www.instagram.com/lowernobhillcleanup\nDetails: https:
 //sf.funcheap.com/lower-nob-hill-weekly-cleanup-w-free-lunch-for-volunteer
 s-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/IMG_27
 662.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Lower Nob Hill Neighborhood/Another Cafe\, 1191 Pine Street (meet
  on Leavenworth St. side)\, San Francisco
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/lower-nob-hill-weekly-cleanup-w-free-lunch-for
 -volunteers-sf/
END:VEVENT
