SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Comedy Event Types Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerLower Nob Hill Weekly Cleanup\
 nSundays\, 9:45 AM to 11:00 AM\n\nMeet outside Another Cafe at 1191 Pine S
 t\nGrab a picker\, meet the people on your block\, and leave the sidewalks
  cleaner than you found them. We provide all the supplies: grabbers\, bags
 \, gloves\, and vests. Just wear comfortable shoes and show up.\nWhat volu
 nteers get:\n\nA free sandwich\, salad\, or drink and pastry from Another 
 Cafe\, ready when the cleanup ends\nA chance at free tickets to that eveni
 ng’s 7:45 PM stand-up comedy show at Cheaper Than Therapy (533 Sutter St
 )\, a neighborhood comedy club around the corner from Union Square. Seats 
 are limited each week and go to volunteers who claim them at check-in.\n\n
 Everyone is welcome\, including first-timers\, families\, and drop-ins. Ch
 eck in with a QR code when you arrive. (Comedy tickets are for volunteers 
 18+.)\nOrganized by neighborhood volunteers in partnership with Civic Joy 
 Fund and SF Public Works.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.instagram.com/lo
 wernobhillcleanup\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/nob-hill-weekly-cleanu
 p-free-lunch-volunteers-sf-2/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_27
 66.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Lower Nob Hill Neighborhood/Another Cafe\, 1191 Pine Street (meet
  on Leavenworth St. side)\, San Francisco
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/nob-hill-weekly-cleanup-free-lunch-volunteers-
 sf-2/
END:VEVENT
