DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerEmil AlexGiant bubbles\, big l
 aughs and fantastic circus skills. Circus of Bubbles LIVE! comes to the My
 stic Theatre in Petaluma for one night only on Wednesday\, October 7. Door
 s 6:30 PM\, show 7:00 PM\, you don’t want to miss this with the kids!\nK
 irk Marsh and Jack Weinstock fill the stage with bubbles the size of a sof
 a\, foot juggling\, physical comedy and plenty of audience fun. The show i
 s non-verbal\, so it plays to every age in the room\, from toddlers to gra
 ndparents\, and nobody needs to understand a word to be in on it.\n\nAn ea
 rly family night out in downtown Petaluma. Tickets are $25 in advance\, $3
 0 day of show.\n\n$25.00\n\nTickets: https://wl.seetickets.us/event/circus
 -of-bubbles-live/705683?afflky=MysticTheatre2\nDetails: https://sf.funchea
 p.com/circus-bubbles-live/\nSource: Funcheap SF
