SUMMARY:Mortified
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261009T203000
DTSTAMP:20261006T002614Z
UID:caldiscovery-comedy-549f1a0dab35f23f@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:comedy
DESCRIPTION:MORTIFIED\n\nMortified is a comic excavation of adolescent wri
 ting\, art & media. PS: It totally likes you.\n\nPerforming:\n\nLaurent Ma
 rtini\nLeslie McLean\nAlyssa Sabo\nLori Fowler\n\nHailed as a \\"cultural 
 phenomenon\\" by Newsweek and celebrated for years by the likes of This Am
 erican Life\, The Today Show\, The Onion AV Club\, & Entertainment Weekly\
 , Mortified is a comic excavation of teen angst artifacts (journals\, poem
 s\, letters\, lyrics\, home movies\, schoolwork) as shared by their origin
 al authors -- in front of total strangers!\n\nWhere else can you hear grow
 n men and women confront their past with firsthand tales of their first ki
 ss\, first puff\, worst prom\, fights with mom\, life at bible camp\, wors
 t hand job\, best mall job\, and reasons they deserved to marry Bon Jovi? 
 Submissions come from a wide range of participants\, from professional per
 formers to total amateurs . All in the noble pursuit of self-degradation. 
 Share the shame.\n\nTickets and Seating Information:\n\nGeneral Admission 
 tickets do not include guaranteed seating. When the seats are full\, there
  is ample standing room.\n\nReserved Seating is sold by the chair\, and is
  in the first or second row.\n\nPizza Special: A table for five\, admissio
 n for five\, and a large two topping pizza!\n\nFront Row VIP: A table for 
 five right in front of the stage\, including admission for five and bottle
  service.\n\nDownstairs VIP Booths: These are against the wall with a good
  view of the stage and include admission for six and bottle service.\n\nUp
 stairs VIP...\n\nPublished by DNA Lounge\nContains information from CalDis
 covery (caldiscovery.com)\, ODbL 1.0\n\nDetails: https://www.dnalounge.com
 /calendar/2026/10-09a.html?utm_source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_camp
 aign=san-francisco-ca\nSource: CalDiscovery
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T002614Z
LOCATION:DNA Lounge\, 375 Eleventh Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.dnalounge.com/calendar/2026/10-09a.html?utm_source=caldisc
 overy&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca
END:VEVENT
