CATEGORIES:Comedy Event Types Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event Organizerticketful.appWelcome to Kangar
 oo Court: a fully-improvised courtroom comedy where you\, the jury\, decid
 e the verdict.\nShare your past slights\, pet peeves\, or personal grievan
 ces\, and we’ll put them on trial. No case is too trivial\, and the pett
 ier the “crime\,” the better the drama. We’ll take it all the way 
 — opening statements\, cross-examinations\, objections\, and closing arg
 uments — until justice is finally served.\n\nSince 2018\, Kangaroo Court
  has played on the main stage at SF’s Endgames Improv\, with touring sho
 ws at The Pit in NYC and Austin’s Out of Bounds Comedy Festival. The rot
 ating cast features some of the Bay Area’s top improvisers\, performing 
 and teaching at Endgames\, All Out Comedy\, and the Drunk Theatre Company.
 \n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://ticketful.app/events/31nwlkseh910/ca-san-fran
 cisco/comedy/kangaroo-court-2026-10-09\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/k
 angaroo-court/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/26d562
 cd-0303-4a8b-b264-595691402b72.avif
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Eclectic Box\, 446 Valencia Street San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/kangaroo-court/
END:VEVENT
