DESCRIPTION:About\nEvent Features\nGallery\nPlan Your Visit\nTickets\n\nBA
 TS Improv\n\nExplore the world of improv with Fort Mason Center For Arts &
  Culture resident organization BATS Improv. Saturday nights and select Sun
 day nights offer in-person shows at the Bayfront Theatre in Building B.\n\
 nBATS IMPROV DETAILS\n\nLa Vida Loca: An Improvised Telenovela ignites pas
 sions on Saturday\, September 19 and 26\, 2026\, 8:00 p.m. to 10:00 p.m.\n
 \nHalloween season offers The Improvised Twilight Zone on Saturday\, Octob
 er 3 and 10\, 2026. Trick Or Treat: Fun-Size Spooky Scenes rings doorbells
  on October 17 and 24\, 2026. Double Creature: A Horrifying Double Feature
  stalks the stage on Saturday\, October 31\, 2026. All shows run 8:00 p.m.
  to 10:00 p.m.\n\nSaturdays in November are set for Theatresports\, Novemb
 er 7 to 26\, 8:00 p.m. to 10:00 p.m.\n\nThe Anniversary Show & Gala Dinner
  sets up on Friday\, November 13\, 2026\, 6:00 p.m. to 11:00 p.m.\n\nHolid
 ay favorite An Improvised Dickens Musical returns on Saturdays\, December 
 5 to 26\, 2026. Noir Year’s Eve blasts off on Thursday\, December 31\, 2
 026. Both shows run 8:00 p.m. to 10:00 p.m.\n\nFor more improv\, visit the
  BATS YouTube video channel for free digital clips of BATS Improv’s grea
 test hits. Online shows from past shows\, as well as other BATS Improv ree
 ls\, are free to view by following Facebook links.\n\nTrick Or Treat: Fun-
 Size Spooky Scenes\n\nDouble Creature: A Horrifying Double Feature\n\nThea
 tresports\n\nAn Improvised Dickens Musical\n\nNoir Year’s Eve\n\nPlan Yo
 ur Visit\n\nDates &...\n\nPublished by Fort Mason Center for Arts & Cultur
 e\nContains information from CalDiscovery (caldiscovery.com)\, ODbL 1.0\n\
 nDetails: https://fortmason.org/event/bats-improv-shows-2026-2/2026-10-10/
 ?utm_source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca\nSou
 rce: CalDiscovery
