SUMMARY:Dean Evans: Les Pervers - Flop Fest!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T203000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:dothebay-17887548@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Comedy
DESCRIPTION:Renowned Clown and Mime artist Dean Evans presents a series of
  darkly comedic personas\, one after another\, in a tour de force of physi
 cal transformation. Dean slips between an Edgar Allan Poe–esque horror w
 riter\, a retired showgirl from Branson Missouri\, a dying Mime gasping ou
 t one last performance\, and an entity simply known as "Slime Rat" and mor
 e. Evans takes us on a tour of the dark recesses of their clown brain in t
 his hour long perverse Spoon River Anthology.\n\n$20 - 40\, NOTAFLOF\n\nTi
 ckets: https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/dean-evans-les-pervers-flop-f
