DESCRIPTION:Infamous Boom Boom Comedy Showcase (3rd Wednesdays)\n\nSF’s 
 longest-running monthly comedy showcase every 3rd Wednesday. Rising comics
 \, surprise guests\, unforgettable laughs in a legendary room.\n\nJoin us 
 for the always anticipated monthly and highly regarded Value Culture BOOM 
 BOOM Comedy Showcase at the famous Boom Boom Room on Fillmore Street since
  2023!\n\nThe showcase is the longest running monthly showcase active in t
 he city\, and has been voted one of the top date nights in SF.\n\n21+\, Fr
 ee with RSVP\, No Drink Minimum\, ($10 suggested tip)\nComics are performi
 ng for tips. Reserved Seating available for purchase.\n\n7:30 Doors/ 8:00p
 m Showtime roughly 60-90 minutes\, with more drinks and DJ music to follow
 .\nAddress: 1601 Fillmore St.\, San Francisco\, CA 94115\n\nPlease help us
  spread the word. Thank you for the support every 3rd Wednesday of the mon
 th!\n\nThis special comedy event showcases new comics every month on 3rd W
 ednesdays. Hosted by future local comedy legends Stephanie Block\, Paul Ro
 bertson and often special guests... sometimes non profit Value Culture's l
 eader Adam Swig (if Dave Chappelle doesn't show up...) Always expect lots 
 of Special Guests and the unexpected!\n\nThis event supports independent c
 omics\, this independent venue\, diversity and inclusion\, the Western Add
 ition neighborhood\, and a non profit organization. The event is presented
  by Value Culture\, a California 501c3 non profit and the Boom Boom Room. 
 This is the fourth year of the showcase (formerly at the Hungry i)...\n\nF
 ree\nValue Culture\n\nTickets: valueculture.org/comedy\nDetails: https://d
 othebay.com/events/2026/10/21/infamous-boom-boom-comedy-showcase-3rd-wedne
 sdays-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
