  Free Golden Boy Pizza | SF\nCoit Comedy\nCoit Comedy is a stand-up comedy
  show every last Thursday of every month in the basement of historic bar C
 olumbus Cafe in North Beach featuring the best comedians in the bay and fr
 ee Golden Boy Pizza.\nMany of the comics you can expect to see you will ha
 ve seen at Cobbs\, SF Punchline\, Vice Land\, Comedy Central and more.\nEv
 ery ticket requires a 1 drink minimum and includes the show and free Golde
 n Boy Pizza (pepperoni and cheese while it lasts). Normally $10\, 50% off 
 with promo code “funcheap”. 1 drink minimum requirement.\n\nThe baseme
 nt is intimate (perfect for comedy) and features a full bar. Hosted by loc
 al comedians Travis Thielen and Cole Chapman.\n\nUpcoming Coit Comedy: Sta
 nd Up Comedy & Free Golden Boy Pizza | SF Events\nThu 10/29 Coit Comedy: S
 tand Up Comedy & Free Golden Boy Pizza | SFThu 11/26 Coit Comedy: Stand Up
