  San Francisco Magic Theater\, we don't give you a "show." We hand you an 
 experience... a carefully engineered collision of impossible mentalism\, l
 augh-out-loud comedy\, and illusions that punch through the wall of your r
 eality.What You'll DoStep off the streets of SF and into our historic Moro
 ccan-inspired speakeasy\, you will enjoy handcrafted cocktails\, Moroccan 
 appetizers\, and live close-up magic.Then enter our jewel-box theater for 
 Jay Alexander's mind-twisting mix of magic\, psychology\, and lie detectio
 n that will leave you amazed and laughing.Why It's Legit- Mentalist Jay Al
 exander... the performer who's astonished Bono\, made John Cleese grin lik
 e a schoolboy\, and been trusted by The Rolling Stones and Robin Williams.
 - 5-star rating from 1.5K+ Google reviews - one of SF's top-rated events- 
 Seen on MTV\, TEDx\, Good Morning America\, and the Today ShowBest For- A 
 memorable date night\, impressing visitors\, or an elevated/unique evening
  out with friends or family.This is not just entertainment. This is the re
 surrection of your sense of wonder-set inside a 45-seat speakeasy with a M
 oroccan flair.Find out why this is the highest-rated show in the city and 
 leave with a story to tell.Pick your date and reserve your seats today!***
